  "audit": {
    "toleranceMm": 0.02,
    "dimensionTargets": [
      "Filter is exactly 76.2 × 76.2 × 6.35 mm (3 × 3 × 1/4 inch).",
      "Default holder envelope is 82 × 84.4 × 15.35 mm.",
      "The nominal channel is 77.2 mm wide and 7.15 mm high; the two front detents narrow it locally to 75.4 mm.",
      "Three 5 mm lips overlap the pad by 4.5 mm along each side and rear, leaving 82.98% exposed.",
      "Rounded 4 mm long front side detents engage each nominal pad edge by 0.4 mm; the seated front edge clears them by 0.5 mm."
    ],
    "invariants": [
      "A solid flat back bonds to the underside of the trash-can lid.",
      "Both sides and the rear have retaining lips; the trash-facing center remains open.",
      "The front has no crossbar. Two integral rounded side detents require a flexible pad to compress at its edges during insertion and removal.",
      "The seated filter rests behind the front detents with a 0.5 mm gap and 0.5 mm nominal rear clearance.",
      "Lip undersides rise inward at 45 degrees above the clear filter channel.",
      "One outward-oriented manifold shell rests on its glue face at Z = 0.",
      "Filter preview and withdrawal never change the printed holder or exported STL; preview does not simulate pad compression.",
      "Actual pad compressibility, detent force, repeated use and lid adhesion require a physical check."
